{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-01T05:46:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116768888700756081"],"id":"2116768888700756081","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1803,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"你问我害怕死亡吗，我说死亡是所有生命的终局。但你死了。我发现我没法不去幻想如果你仍然活着会是怎样的情形","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116768888700756081"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-01T05:44:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116768432276619391"],"id":"2116768432276619391","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1821,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"喜欢就是很片面的，爱的话是喜欢上每一个片面的结合体","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116768432276619391"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T15:19:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116550510769762813"],"id":"2116550510769762813","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5275,"like_count":110,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":11},"text":"我就是那种一边装忧郁说只要你幸福我怎样都无所谓了，一边把对方强奸了的人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116550510769762813"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T14:39:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116540633158676622"],"id":"2116540633158676622","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1166,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"当初以为多特别多放不下的人如今放下了，以为多困难多过不去的坎也过去了，不，是被磨平了，人生的丁香结是解不完的，如果我们忽视掉代价，没有什么坎是过不去的，没有什么人是放不下的，一切都会好的，对吧。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116540633158676622"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T14:38:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116540353214111877"],"id":"2116540353214111877","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1532,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"人长大，心也大了。我越来越难摸清楚里面有什么，越来越难填满它。只是回忆起来才发现，原来这样简单就能幸福的能力我曾经也是有的，有这么多。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116540353214111877"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T11:45:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116496800769360172"],"id":"2116496800769360172","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1746,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我：上班死了 https://t.co/rdDNx8CNC5","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116496800769360172"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T11:38:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116494938502509012"],"id":"2116494938502509012","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1377,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"日复一日地在0个幸福里面捞出了100个报应","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116494938502509012"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T11:34:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116493985527316718"],"id":"2116493985527316718","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1314,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我放弃挣扎了老天爷，我不找那个最爱我的人了，我要找那个最恨我的人然后杀死我","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116493985527316718"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T10:05:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116471565596643641"],"id":"2116471565596643641","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":7824,"like_count":231,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":20},"text":"选错一个人的代价就是 我的人生会停滞好几年","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116471565596643641"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T10:03:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116471162540880076"],"id":"2116471162540880076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2015,"like_count":45,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我从未怪过你，真的，哪怕那些事情真的伤害到了我","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116471162540880076"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T09:53:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116468682230837331"],"id":"2116468682230837331","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":5452,"like_count":132,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":35},"text":"咬我吧，亲我吧，打我吧，在我身上留下属于你的痕迹我才能切切实实感受到你的爱，才能摸到你对我的感情","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116468682230837331"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T09:50:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116467882674815194"],"id":"2116467882674815194","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":123,"impression_count":28334,"like_count":1064,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":66,"retweet_count":138},"text":"我爱人的方式是跟我生命里很多人学的，我跟我妈妈学会爱一个人就给他花钱，跟我爸爸学会原谅一切伤害，跟我爱的第一个男孩子学会温柔地讲话，又学会各种讨人欢心的小把戏和送礼物的技巧，我把每个我觉得是爱的东西都学过来，然后一次性塞给我爱的人，你问这些里面哪一个部分属于我自己，我自己的爱呢，","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116467882674815194"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T09:46:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116466732038836635"],"id":"2116466732038836635","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":53,"impression_count":12282,"like_count":653,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":65},"text":"身体里有太多眼泪无法及时排出，生命中有太多想要流泪却连它都无力的瞬间，导致我的体内存满了泪水，超出人体的含水量。它占着血液的位置，流过身体的每个位置除了双眼。让我变得缓慢，让我变得水肿，让我只能拖着泪水假装什么也没发生地行走着行走着。缓慢和水肿让我的感受也变得迟钝，接触这个世界时","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116466732038836635"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T09:46:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116466709762850837"],"id":"2116466709762850837","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1010,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"哭不出来我的身体就开始流血。鼻血、莫名其妙出现的淤血块、布满眼球的红血丝，还有我因为害怕面对这个世界而缩水的肩膀，脆弱到碰到这里任何东西就疼痛的指甲，城市一哭泣就跟着流泪的膝盖，以及心脏","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116466709762850837"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T09:43:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116466169372967197"],"id":"2116466169372967197","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":419,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"累的我想一直哭","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116466169372967197"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-31T09:38:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2116464816516964612"],"id":"2116464816516964612","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":873,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我好难受。在这个阶段回顾失败并不是一个正确的选择，可我在意识到之前这么做了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2116464816516964612"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T15:24:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115102353418592730"],"id":"2115102353418592730","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3668,"like_count":141,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":15},"text":"逃避是我人生的主旋律，逃避中考高考，逃避受限的未成年，逃避该死的应试教育，逃避讨厌的教育与规训，逃避家，逃避学校，逃避那些带给我不定时阵痛的一切，甚至逃避成长本身。但现在我不用逃避了，那我下一步该往哪走，恨的东西不在了，爱的也稀疏平常，什么是珍贵的。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115102353418592730"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T15:14:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115099952359911474"],"id":"2115099952359911474","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2301,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"我后悔过无数次自己为什么要推开你，为什么要把你推开，不是说时间是一杯水，可以净人，净事，净物吗，这些东西为什么随时间推移我越来越后悔和痛苦呢。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115099952359911474"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T15:11:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115099076043980973"],"id":"2115099076043980973","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":2196,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":3},"text":"其实我不清楚我到底是真的喜欢你吗，还是享受着单恋一个人时的酸涩，难道我是恋痛着吗。我好奇你的一切。想知道你初中第一次跳高的时候会不会紧张，获奖时候的自豪到笑弯的眼睛。好奇你嘴角的小痣。如果有机会，我想摸仔细的摸过右手握笔写出的茧。\n到底是喜欢还是习惯，是你的话我不在意结果。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115099076043980973"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T15:03:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115097155052716137"],"id":"2115097155052716137","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1396,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"曾经对你最好的祝福是好好享受这个世界，后来才发现也有另一句很好的祝福，那是一开始就该胎死腹中。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115097155052716137"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T15:00:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115096358898311543"],"id":"2115096358898311543","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1025,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我恐惧遗忘，我恐惧着对我自己的背叛。坐在电脑前看着那个十年前设下的保密问题，思索良久，毫无头绪。我最喜欢的东西。我的梦想。我已经将它们全都忘记了，所以我理所当然被过往的自己拒之门外","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115096358898311543"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T14:57:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115095664887837065"],"id":"2115095664887837065","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1127,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我很容易做梦，梦里不分过去和现在，就算是很久没联系的人也会以熟人的身份出现在梦里。但你一次也没有来过。我想我不可能不留恋你，指责你更是没有道理。总不能留恋和逃避其实可以同时存在","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115095664887837065"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T14:56:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115095401598726245"],"id":"2115095401598726245","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":716,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"世界上大多事物都是真的才有价值，可真心这东西往往一文不值","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115095401598726245"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T14:54:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115094844314148897"],"id":"2115094844314148897","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":809,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"以前我把“镜头不会骗人”理解为镜头会放大缺点，现在我想“镜头不会骗人”真正的含义是镜头下是否存在爱一目了然。难道模糊不清的爱不是爱吗？难道破碎扭曲的爱不是爱吗？有时候情绪才是视觉张力，不必过度掩埋和防御","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2115094844314148897"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:53:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114928426415165551"],"id":"2114928426415165551","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1363,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":6},"text":"我觉得精神病实在是太沉重也太无从下手的枷锁，命运，或者别的什么，当它降临的时候你才知道原来过去的所有爱所有恨，所有期待所有希望，全部都不堪一击。真的完全不堪一击。那种感受无法对任何非病友诉说，甚至病友也可能无法理解，那种隔膜一样的生活，在真空地带苦苦挣扎抵达正常的生活。曾经的一切","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114928426415165551"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2116768888700756081","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlx97f30jcfhpq3azgcjc02n68ot","oldest_id":"2114928426415165551","result_count":25}}